    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directive: Intercept is a dynamic, fast-paced third-person flight combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on an Earth on the edge of climate collapse, a sudden alien invasion threatens the last surviving cities. You are an elite military pilot\u2014humanity's last line of defense\u2014and it\u2019s time to take the skies and push the invaders back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, unlock new aircraft and equipment, and customize your fighter to adapt to a wide range of combat scenarios.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directive: Intercept is a dynamic, fast-paced third-person flight combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on an Earth on the edge of climate collapse, a sudden alien invasion threatens the last surviving cities. You are an elite military pilot\u2014humanity's last line of defense\u2014and it\u2019s time to take the skies and push the invaders back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, unlock new aircraft and equipment, and customize your fighter to adapt to a wide range of combat scenarios.</p>",
